# Content & Navigation

## Language
- User-facing text: **Persian**
- Keep tone consistent with existing pages (فروشگاه، خانه، تماس با ما)

## Contact & social — use `brand` config
- Phone: `brand.phone` / `brand.phoneTel`
- Address: `brand.address`
- Instagram, Telegram, WhatsApp: `brand.social.*`
- Do not hardcode contact details in multiple files

## Footer / nav links
- Edit `footerNavItems` and `mainNavItems` in `src/data/navigation.ts`
- **Only link to routes that exist** under `src/app/`
- Missing pages: **comment out** the entry until the page is added, then uncomment

```ts
// { name: "مرجوعی", path: "/returns" },  // uncomment when page exists
```

## Payment badges
- `paymentMethods` in `navigation.ts` — currently ZarinPal + Bank Saman SVGs in `public/assets/img/`

## Policies (keep aligned across FAQ, advantages, copy)
- Free shipping: orders over **1 million تومان**
- Returns: **7 days**
- Promo code: `brand.promoCode`
